@startuml
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
actor User
participant "UI Layer\n(LoginView)" as UI
participant "Logic Layer\n(UserService)" as Logic
database "Database\n(UserRepository)" as DB

User -> UI : 1. Enter Username & Password
activate UI
UI -> Logic : 2. Authentication Request
activate Logic
Logic -> DB : 3. Find User by Username
activate DB
DB --> Logic : 4. Return User Object (incl. Hashed Password)
deactivate DB
Logic -> Logic : 5. Validate Password Hash & Create Secure Session
Logic --> UI : 6. Auth Success
deactivate Logic
UI --> User : 7. Redirect to HomeView / Dashboard
deactivate UI
@enduml